                    <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">What are the reasons annexed to the fourth commandment?</span>
                  </span>
                  <p class="faith-topic-row-excerpt">The reasons annexed to the fourth commandment are, God’s allowing us six days of the week for our own employments, His challenging a special propriety in the seventh, His own example, and His blessing…</p>
