                    <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">Which is the fifth commandment?</span>
                  </span>
                  <p class="faith-topic-row-excerpt">The fifth commandment is, “Honor thy father and thy mother: that thy days may be long upon the land which the Lord thy God giveth thee.”</p>
