                    <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">What is required in the fifth commandment?</span>
                  </span>
                  <p class="faith-topic-row-excerpt">The fifth commandment requireth the preserving the honor, and performing the duties, belonging to every one in their several places and relations, as superiors, inferiors, or equals.</p>
