                    <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">What is the reason annexed to the fifth commandment?</span>
                  </span>
                  <p class="faith-topic-row-excerpt">The reason annexed to the fifth commandment is a promise of long life and prosperity (as far as it shall serve for God’s glory, and their own good) to all such as keep this commandment.</p>
