                    <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">What is forbidden in the sixth commandment?</span>
                  </span>
                  <p class="faith-topic-row-excerpt">The sixth commandment forbiddeth the taking away of our own life, or the life of our neighbor unjustly, or whatsoever tendeth thereunto.</p>
                  <span class="faith-topic-row-read">Read in context <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
